#X obj 300 889 cnv 1 53 21 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -245695 -1 0;
#X text 300 889 TARGET: client selector. If '*' or 'all' — send message
to all clients. If 'first' — send message to the first connected client.
If 'last' — send message to the last connected client. If 'id' or '=='
— send message to the client with the specified ID. If 'except' or
'!=' — send message to all clients except the specified one. Type:
symbol. Allowed values: * \, all \, first \, last \, id \, == \, !=
\, except.;
